{"v":3,"catch":"釋放你的戰士，征服激烈的競技場戰鬥。","desc":"OFC - Ultimate Fighting Club 將你帶入殘酷無情的格鬥世界，在這裡唯一的規則就是勝利。進入一個受真實 OFC 錦標賽原始強度啟發的格鬥俱樂部，訓練你的戰士，超越所有對手，奪取真正的冠軍榮耀。\n\n主要特色：\n\t•\t選擇你的戰士：找到最符合你風格的格鬥者。每位戰士都擁有獨特能力，影響策略、速度和力量。\n\t•\t擴充名單：解鎖新戰士，並嘗試不同的技巧、戰術與對戰方式。\n\t•\t訓練與升級：提升關鍵數值——速度、耐力、力量、生命與防禦。為每一場戰鬥做好準備，主宰你的對手。\n\t•\t掌握戰鬥：施展毀滅性的拳擊與踢擊，格擋敵方攻擊，洞察對手策略並打出改變局勢的重擊。\n\n踏入擂台，考驗你的技巧，體驗最激烈、最令人腎上腺素飆升的格鬥！","publisher":"XenoXeno","release":"2025-10-23","genres":["格鬥","模擬","運動","角色扮演"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"輔12歳級","size":"Switch 2 1.7GB / Switch 1.7GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/1b62b8f2a4df3a6355874392e3e1004fb26ab510552e02514dc17708be964474.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dedb797decd8e8d697293a0e5347c1194a39f53cdd3694f0ac382427027df3a3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/95a11abe30ceaad2515d4bea02b83287312821ae909ced11c58a9f92c06c49a3.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/5bb2ff804cd5559381f07ba52877ab09d92b596165d588965424943c439945a7.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8c1216995f859f8eaea01df69e4eaf9aa6235b36051a5bc3cf752696bb337165.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e4be83d74f241e2545f0bed1ade0576e795e8f4db803bc3a449e7d9c6e3881e1.jpg"],"titleId":"0100381025056000","dlc":[{"id":"70050000070265","name":"OFC – Ultimate Fighting Club: Power Boost","img":"7afca1194442c7544f4244457c3b71af750e6f797fca35e4e8046a888cc5d8e4","date":"2026-03-05","mem":false},{"id":"70050000074789","name":"OFC - Ultimate Fighting Club: Born to Fight","img":"4ae25b167a3219064b1975df314e8c61aa6ca3a90b303e95073f10b778c4384b","date":"2026-06-11","mem":false},{"id":"70050000081600","name":"OFC - Ultimate Fighting Club: Ring Legend","img":"1d5fbcd12098a9857ccd62c600f3b40186643c54e9fc8f581b3f17b8cf85ce50","date":"2026-10-01","mem":false}]}